# Dockerfile-specific allowlist: private state never enters the build context.
**
!requirements.txt
!app/
!app/**
!data_pipeline/
!data_pipeline/**
!staging/
!staging/entrypoint.py
!scripts/
!scripts/paper_staging_smoke.py
!scripts/kalshi_perps_staging_smoke.py
**/.env*
**/.state
**/.state/**
**/.runtime
**/.runtime/**
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/credentials
**/credentials/**
**/.aws
**/.aws/**
**/.ssh
**/.ssh/**
**/*.pem
**/*.key
